                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Image and video Synthesis is a collection of interested images and video about a theme. However, a video is a sequence of images (called frames) captured and eventually displayed at a given frequency. By stopping at a specific frame of the sequence, a single video frame, i.e. an image, is obtained."@en .


