                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "con212"@en ;
                     rdfs:label "Incremental Learning"@en ;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A methodology of machine learning where an AI model learns and enhances its knowledge progressively, without forgetting previously acquired information."@en .


