###  http://aiod.eu/data/schemas/RecursiveLearning
:RecursiveLearning rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> :Approach ;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "con371"@en ;
                   rdfs:label "Recursive Learning"@en ;
                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Recursive learning is an attractive alternative learning technique to decision trees. Using recursive learning with sufficient depth of recursion guarantees its resulted efficiency that is compared with the conventional branch-and-bound technique."@en .


###  http://aiod.eu/data/schemas/RefinementPlanning
:RefinementPlanning rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
